[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2986593833","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107695#issuecomment-2986593833","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107695","id":2986593833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yA84p","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T04:48:47Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T04:48:47Z","body":"You should get an error in this case. You can't run a game without importing assets first. However, the error you get should say \"can't run game, you need to open the project in the editor at least once\". Which is the typically error message you received when there are missing assets","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2986593833/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2986764973","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107695#issuecomment-2986764973","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107695","id":2986764973,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yBmqt","user":{"login":"DragonAxe","id":12703200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzAzMjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12703200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonAxe","html_url":"https://github.com/DragonAxe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonAxe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonAxe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonAxe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonAxe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonAxe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonAxe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonAxe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonAxe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DragonAxe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T06:14:40Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T06:14:40Z","body":"What do you think about automatically triggering an asset import if it hasn't been done yet? This would be more convenient for workflows involving external editors like VSCode, or when using run scripts from a Rust GDExtension project.\n\nI do get \"Can't run project: Assets need to be imported first. Please edit the project to trigger the initial import.\" when I try to open a project from the project manager:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d280969f-35ba-4eb6-bdfa-c142c76bd15e)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2986764973/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989128136","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107695#issuecomment-2989128136","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107695","id":2989128136,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yKnnI","user":{"login":"Fireye04","id":45439844,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDM5ODQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45439844?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04","html_url":"https://github.com/Fireye04","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T20:51:04Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T20:51:04Z","body":"Can reproduce on arch linux hyprland with godot 4.1.1:\n```\nERROR: Unable to open file: res://.godot/imported/icon.svg-218a8f2b3041327d8a5756f3a245f83b.ctex.\n   at: _load_data (scene/resources/compressed_texture.cpp:41)\nERROR: Failed loading resource: res://.godot/imported/icon.svg-218a8f2b3041327d8a5756f3a245f83b.ctex. Make sure resources have been imported by opening the project in the editor at least once.\n   at: _load (core/io/resource_loader.cpp:343)\nERROR: Failed loading resource: res://icon.svg. Make sure resources have been imported by opening the project in the editor at least once.\n   at: _load (core/io/resource_loader.cpp:343)\nERROR: res://main.tscn:7 - Parse Error: [ext_resource] referenced non-existent resource at: res://icon.svg.\n   at: _printerr (scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp:39)\n```\n\nI concur that automatically triggering asset import would definitely be the cleanest solution here, at least from a user perspective. What would something like that involve?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989128136/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009524455","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107695#issuecomment-3009524455","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107695","id":3009524455,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zYbLn","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-26T18:48:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T18:48:38Z","body":"I can also reproduce this issue. No need to delete the entire `.godot` directory, deleting `.godot/uid_cache.bin` seems to be enough.\n\nIt looks like it's because it can't find the main scene which in the `project.godot` file is specified by its UID. Manually editing the `project.godot` file to use `res://` path instead of `uid://` avoids the issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009524455/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009628105","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107695#issuecomment-3009628105","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107695","id":3009628105,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zY0fJ","user":{"login":"Fireye04","id":45439844,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDM5ODQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45439844?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04","html_url":"https://github.com/Fireye04","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fireye04/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-26T19:05:59Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T19:05:59Z","body":"Interesting! As a potential solution, both `uid://` and `res://` could be stored for the main scene, using UID by default (to avoid overly relying on a specific file path), and falling back to `res://` if the UID happens to not be present? \n\nIn that case the project would only crash if the uid cache had not been yet generated AND the main scene had been moved, which would be a pretty significant improvement IMO","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009628105/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009713275","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107695#issuecomment-3009713275","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107695","id":3009713275,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zZJR7","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-26T19:35:59Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T19:35:59Z","body":"CC @KoBeWi ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009713275/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009924198","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107695#issuecomment-3009924198","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107695","id":3009924198,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zZ8xm","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-26T20:38:55Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T20:38:55Z","body":"You can't import project without starting editor. You can launch with `--editor --quit` or `--import` to import files, and then run the project normally.\n\n> As a potential solution, both uid:// and res:// could be stored for the main scene\n\nThat won't help if you have other non-imported Resources, e.g. if the main scene uses a texture, and it's not imported, it will fail too.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009924198/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3014506875","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107695#issuecomment-3014506875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107695","id":3014506875,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zrbl7","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-27T22:35:51Z","updated_at":"2025-06-27T22:35:51Z","body":"That's a good point, if the project has resources that need to be imported. However, in my case it's only the main scene that's an issue. I imagine that's why the message says _\"Couldn't detect whether to run the editor, the project manager or a specific project. Aborting.\"_\n\nI think we should be able to resolve scenes at least. Then, if the project has resources that need to be imported, we can hopefully provide a better error message.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3014506875/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]